In [[Helldivers 2]], a [[Helldiver]] is deployed to Operations where they complete Missions and Tactical Objectives issued by [[Federation of Super Earth|Super Earth]].

=== Planetary Campaign Status ===
Only planets that are under a '''liberation campaign''' or an '''invasion campaign''' will be subject to [[Operation Modifiers]], whereas [[Planets and Sectors|planets]] under '''defense campaigns''' are completely absent of any Operation Modifiers.
<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed"><br>

==== Liberation Campaign ====
{{Quote|Our enemies have forced conflict upon this region. There can be no peace until they are defeated.|Operation description of a '''Peacekeeping Operation'''}}
{{Quote|Multiple opportunities to disrupt the enemy's opaque and sinister machinations have been identified in this region. Illuminate forces are highly concentrated here; expect significant resistance.<br><br>Disrupt their schemes and restore peace to this area.|Operation description of a '''Disrupt Illuminate''' Operation}}
{{Quote|This city is under enemy control, it must be reclaimed in the name of Freedom.|Operation description of a '''City Operation''' under enemy control}}
{{Quote|Megafactories like these double as strategic command nodes and industrial cores for large-scale Cyborg and Automaton production. <br><br> Storm its walls and reduce this socialist hub to rubble.|Operation description of a '''Megafactory Operation'''}}
{{Quote|Enemy defenses in this area make prolonged Super Destroyer deployment impossible for certain missions. Be prepared to operate with severely limited Super Destroyer support.|Operation description of a '''Commando Operation'''}}

==== Defense Campaign ====
{{Quote|The Terminid swarm has descended on this planet and threatens to infest it. <br><br> We must repel this vile incursion before it is too late!|Operation description of a '''Defend Planet''' operation against the {{Terminid}} [[Terminids]]}}
{{Quote|An Automaton invasion fleet is attacking this planet. <br><br> We must repel the invading forces before it is too late!|Operation description of a '''Defend Planet''' operation against the {{Automaton}} [[Automatons]]}}
