{{Quote|While most Terminids were killed by the Termicide, some survived and adapted. Now, they threaten to evolve further and take over the entire planet. Every Termicide Dispersion Tower on this planet must be shut down as soon as possible.|Operation description of a '''Deactivate Terminid Control System''' Operation}}
{{Quote|We must seize this opportunity to destroy the Terminid Supercolony. Helldivers across the planet will deploy with a limited supply of the exotic matter known as Dark Fluid, and insert it at critical points in the planet's crust.<br><br>Once critical mass is reached, the planet will collapse into a black hole, destroying the threat to Liberty once and for all.|Operation description of a '''Deploy Dark Fluid''' Operation on [[Meridia]]}}
{{Quote|The Gloom may hold the key to stopping the Illuminate from moving the Meridian Singularity. A scientific expedition is being conducted to this planet, at extreme cost and risk. The Helldivers must secure every scrap of useful data on the Gloom.|Planet Description during a '''Gloom Research Expedition'''}}
