== Tactical Objectives ==
'''Tactical Objectives''' (also known as '''Optional Objectives''') are small objectives to complete within a mission, with up to five spawning on a map. Depending on the difficulty and faction, completing them can unlock in-mission rewards, or remove map effects or hazards.

Completing the Tactical Objective will reward Helldivers with {{Currency|Requisition|200}} and {{Currency|Experience|50}}, with an exception for the "Destroy High-Value Target" objective, which awards {{Currency|Experience|222}} and no [[Requisition Slips|Requisition]]. This is before any Difficulty multipliers are applied. Successful Extraction is not required to gain the reward at the end of the mission, with the sole exception of [[Retrieve Mutant Larva]].

Aside from reactivating a [[Radar Station]], here are some other methods to finding Tactical Objectives.
* Attentive Helldivers can memorize the location of all the hotzones shown during mission "Briefing" to narrow down location of undiscovered Tactical Objectives. Since these hotzones are not highlighted on the mission minimap, many of these objectives can be identified with the topographical drawing on the minimap.
** During loadout selection, the SEAF Artillery is displayed as a standard issue stratagem if a SEAF Artillery site has been placed on the mission map. If this stratagem is missing, then the map does not have a SEAF Artillery site.

{{Tactical Objective Table}}

== Mission Result ==
{{Incomplete section|the circumstances under which additional stars are awarded and rating names}}

Missions count as successful if the main objective was complete; otherwise, they are treated as a failure which is possible if the Super Destroyer leaves low orbit before the main objective is completed. Not all five stars are available on every difficulty.

'''First star''' is awarded for main objective completion. Available from {{Difficulty|1}} and onward.
* Its impossible outside of visual bugs due to faulty internet connection to complete the mission and receive no stars at all.

'''Second star''' is awarded for completion of all optional objectives. Available from {{Difficulty|2}} and onward.
* Your squad wont receive this star if you have completed all but one optional objective.

'''Third star''' is awarded for partial destruction of enemy outposts/nests/encampments. Available from {{Difficulty|3}} and onward.
* It is yet to be determined if counts percentage from total outposts, or certain types of outposts, as third star sometimes gets rewarded while destroying 50% of outposts or more, sometimes it counts if 50% of all outposts type destroyed.

'''Fourth star''' is rewarded for destruction of most of enemy outposts/nests/encampments. Available from {{Difficulty|5}} and onward.

'''Fifth star''' reward condition is currently unknown, possibly full clear of entire map. Available from {{Difficulty|7}} and onward.

It is possible to get stars (outside of first one) out of order. For example, upon successful completion and clearing of {{Difficulty|8}} mission except one optional objective, you'll get four out of five stars and they will be displayed from left to right (stars your squad got are on the left, unmet star conditions on the right)

