== Major Orders ==
[[Major Orders]] (abberviated as '''MO''') are community-wide goals given all [[Helldivers]] for them to complete. These direct the community for larger narrative plotlines, which will impact the lore and even the galactic map itself. There is usually only one Major Order active at a time, sometimes with some time in-between, though it is possible to have multiple active at once.

All active Helldivers contribute to the completion of the Major Order, directly or indirectly. Depending on the planets and/or fronts being issued in the Major Order, their participation may help or hinder its combat effectiveness.

Upon completion, [[Medals]] will be rewarded, though it is possible to be rewarded with other items, such as [[Stratagems]] or cosmetic items. In order to be rewarded, players must be active within that time period, otherwise the reward will not be given to them.

=== Minor Orders / Strategic Opportunities / Strategic Threats ===
Helldivers may also receive Minor Orders, Strategic Opportunities, and Strategic Threats during on-going Major Orders, typcially on a different Faction being the target. It's completion can reward surplus stratagem usage instead of the usual Medals, though it is possible for them to directly affect the current MO by altering its win parameters.

Strategic Threats are instances of a major effect causing large-scale issues, affecting Helldivers galactic-wide. Due to their large effects, resolving them is highly advised, as it could removed various debuffs related to them.

Failure to complete them typically does not directly cause any negative impacts, though the time lost attempting to complete them can be seen as such.

== Personal Orders ==
All Helldivers daily are given optional [[Personal Orders]] (abbreviated as '''PO''') to complete, which involves completing certain goals on a planet. These may involve killing a number of enemies (in general or with a certain weapon), collecting certain samples, or various mission-related objectives (extracting, sub-objectives, etc.). Depending on the PO, fellow Helldivers can contribute, increasing its completion success rate.

Personal Orders last 24 hours and rest at <code>9:00 AM UTC</code>, with each Helldiver completes their Personal Order individually. Upon completion, they are rewarded 15 Medals.

